{% comment %}
  Section contract.
  Journal story (article template), board 4 frame 4 (spec/journal-story.md). "← All stories" (JRN-007), the beat
  pager "n / N ‹ ›" (JRN-009) at the top right, the category eyebrow from the article's `category:<label>` tag
  (JRN-008, uppercased by CSS), the set name (H1) and headline from the title "Name: Headline", the standfirst
  (JRN-010, the body's first paragraph), the hero (the set's chapter art, bottom crop, on its colour; ≤1.3× source),
  the article excerpt as the pull headline, then the story beats (the body's <section class="di-story-slide">
  moments) as a swipeable scroll-snap track that the top pager drives (st-beats.js; swipe works without JS).
  Then "Shop {set} →" (JRN-011, only while the set's product is live, G5) and "More stories from the Journal"
  (JRN-013): three other stories in board order. "Next story" (JRN-012) is omitted: the board has no room (T81).
  @example
  <!-- templates/article.json and article.desi.json -->
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign campaigns = shop.metaobjects.small_talk_campaign.values
  assign article_campaign = nil
  for c in campaigns
    if c.journal.value.id == article.id
      assign article_campaign = c
      break
    endif
  endfor
  assign key = article_campaign.system.handle

  assign title_parts = article.title | split: ': '
  assign story_title = title_parts.first
  assign story_sub = title_parts | slice: 1, 9 | join: ': '

  assign category = ''
  for tag in article.tags
    assign tag_lower = tag | downcase
    if tag_lower contains 'category:'
      assign category = tag | split: ':' | last | strip
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign body = article.content
  assign beats_raw = ''
  assign body_before = body
  assign body_after = ''
  if body contains 'di-story-slide"'
    assign split_open = body | split: '<div class="di-story-slides"'
    assign body_before = split_open.first
    assign rest = split_open | slice: 1, 9 | join: '<div class="di-story-slides"'
    assign rest_parts = rest | split: '</section>'
    assign body_after = rest_parts.last | remove_first: '</div>'
    assign beats_raw = rest | split: '<section class="di-story-slide">'
  endif
  assign body_before = body_before | remove: '<p class="di-eyebrow">' | replace_first: 'An original Small Talk brand story</p>', '' | strip
  assign beats = ''
  if beats_raw != ''
    assign beats = beats_raw | slice: 1, 6
  endif
  if beats.size > 0
    assign body_main = body_after | strip
  else
    assign body_main = body_before | append: body_after | strip
  endif
  assign pull = article.excerpt | strip_html | strip
-%}

<article class="st-story"{% if key != blank %} style="--st-story-set: var(--st-chapter-{{ key }}, {{ article_campaign.background.value }})"{% endif %}>
  {%- if beats.size > 0 -%}<st-beats class="st-story__beats" data-count="{{ beats.size }}">{%- else -%}<div class="st-story__beats">{%- endif -%}
    <div class="st-story__top">
      <a class="st-story__back" href="{{ blog.url }}"><span class="st-arrow" aria-hidden="true">←</span> {{ 'small_talk.journal.all_stories' | t }}</a>
      {%- if beats.size > 0 -%}
        <div class="st-story__pager">
          <p class="st-story__status" aria-live="polite" data-st-beats-status>{{ 'small_talk.journal.beat_status' | t: current: 1, total: beats.size }}</p>
          <button type="button" class="st-story__arrow" data-st-beats-prev aria-label="{{ 'small_talk.journal.previous_beat' | t }}" disabled>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 2 2 10l8 8"/></svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="st-story__arrow" data-st-beats-next aria-label="{{ 'small_talk.journal.next_beat' | t }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m2 2 8 8-8 8"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <header class="st-story__header">
      {%- if category != blank -%}
        <p class="st-story__eyebrow">{{ category | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="st-story__title">{{ story_title | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if story_sub != blank -%}
        <p class="st-story__sub">{% render 'st-sentences', text: story_sub %}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if beats.size > 0 and body_before != blank -%}
        <div class="st-story__standfirst">{{ body_before | strip_html | escape }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>

    {%- if key != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        HD art: Brainwave = the sketchbook still life (journal-story.md), centred at the box width; every other set = its
        landing chapter scene (snippets/st-landing-map, HD pieces), shown as a window of the chapter scaled to the box.
        A set without a window falls back to its chapter crop.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        # Scene window per set, landing px: "y0,sh" = first visible row, and the scene's clip line (where every flat cut
        # edge ends, so none floats inside the box). The box shows y0 … y0 + 463 (372 × 442 at the 390-px scale).
        case key
          when 'on-me'
            assign scene = '604,1067'
          when 'green-flag'
            assign scene = '402,865'
          when 'shaadi-shift'
            assign scene = '312,775'
          when 'wild-card'
            assign scene = '387,850'
          when 'pinky-promise'
            assign scene = '402,865'
          else
            assign scene = ''
        endcase
        assign scene = scene | split: ','
      -%}
      {%- if key == 'diet-cherry' -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            st-fable HD2 fix 1: two layers in the 370 × 441 card at 1.25× the landing scale (card px): the woman bleeds
            past the bottom, the can hand's wrist ends below it and bleeds right, so the art starts at ~20% of the card.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="st-story__hero st-story__hero--layers" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="{{ 'st-hd-diet-cherry-woman.webp' | asset_url }}" width="557" height="909" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" style="--l: -2; --t: 82; --w: 243.6;">
            <img src="{{ 'st-hd-diet-cherry-can-hand.webp' | asset_url }}" width="363" height="646" alt="" loading="eager" decoding="async" style="--l: 227; --t: 174; --w: 151.1;">
          </div>
      {%- elsif key == 'brainwave' -%}
          <div class="st-story__hero st-story__hero--still" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="{{ 'st-hd-brainwave-sketchbook.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1110" height="810" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
          </div>
      {%- elsif scene.size == 2 -%}
          <div class="st-story__hero st-story__hero--scene" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="st-story__scene" style="--y0: {{ scene[0] }}; --sh: {{ scene[1] }};">{% render 'st-landing-map', key: key, field: 'art' %}</div>
          </div>
      {%- else -%}
          <div class="st-story__hero" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
              src="{{ 'st-chapter-' | append: key | append: '.webp' | asset_url }}"
              width="270"
              height="821"
              alt=""
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
            >
          </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif article.image != blank -%}
      <div class="st-story__hero">
        {{ article.image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: alt: article.image.alt, loading: 'eager', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 40rem, 95vw', widths: '400, 600, 800' }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if pull != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%} Board: one sentence per line ("You had the thought. / You did the work. / …"). {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="st-story__pull">{{ pull | escape | replace: '. ', '.<br>' }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if beats.size > 0 -%}
      <ol class="st-story__track" data-st-beats-track tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ story_title | escape }}">
        {%- for beat in beats -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign beat_html = beat | split: '</section>' | first
            assign beat_text = beat_html | split: '<h3>' | last | split: '</h3>' | first | strip_html | strip
          -%}
          <li class="st-story__beat" aria-label="{{ 'small_talk.journal.beat_label' | t: n: forloop.index, total: beats.size }}">
            <p>{{ beat_text | escape }}</p>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- if beats.size > 0 -%}</st-beats>{%- else -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
  {%- if beats.size > 0 -%}
    <script type="module" src="{{ 'st-beats.js' | asset_url }}" fetchpriority="low"></script>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if body_main != blank -%}
    <div class="st-story__body st-rte">{{ body_main }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} JRN-011 "Shop {set}" is gated on G5: only while the set's product is live. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if article_campaign != blank and article_campaign.product.value != blank and article_campaign.product.value.price > 0 and article_campaign.product.value.available -%}
    {%- capture shop_url -%}{% render 'st-campaign-url', campaign: article_campaign %}{%- endcapture -%}
    <a class="st-story__cta" href="{{ shop_url | strip }}">
      {{- 'small_talk.journal.shop_set' | t: name: article_campaign.name.value }} <span class="st-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} More stories (JRN-013): the next three other stories in board order. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign set_order = section.settings.story_order | remove: ' ' | split: ','
    assign more = 0
  -%}
  {%- capture more_list -%}
    {%- for handle in set_order -%}
      {%- if more >= 3 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign c = shop.metaobjects.small_talk_campaign[handle] -%}
      {%- assign other = c.journal.value -%}
      {%- if other != blank and other.id != article.id and other.url != blank -%}
        {%- assign more = more | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- assign other_parts = other.title | split: ': ' -%}
        <li>
          <a class="st-story__more-link" href="{{ other.url }}">
            <span class="st-story__more-media">{%- render 'st-nail-closeup', key: handle, journal: true -%}</span>
            <span class="st-story__more-text">
              <span class="st-story__more-name">{{ other_parts.first | escape }}</span>
              {%- assign more_sub = other_parts | slice: 1, 9 | join: ': ' -%}
              <span class="st-story__more-sub">{% render 'st-sentences', text: more_sub %}</span>
            </span>
            <svg class="st-story__chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m2 2 8 8-8 8"/></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if more > 0 -%}
    <aside class="st-story__more" aria-labelledby="StMore-{{ section.id }}">
      <h2 class="st-story__more-heading" id="StMore-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'small_talk.journal.more_stories' | t }}</h2>
      <ul role="list">{{ more_list }}</ul>
    </aside>
  {%- endif -%}
</article>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Board 4 frame 4 at 390 (spec/journal-story.md). Text column x 22–368; hero x 10–382. */
  .st-story {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 6px 22px var(--st-section-space);
    color: #111;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .st-story__beats {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .st-story__top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .st-story__back {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    justify-self: start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: #111;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .st-story__back:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .st-story__pager {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .st-story__status {
    margin: 0 4px 0 0;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .st-story__arrow {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: #111;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .st-story__arrow svg,
  .st-story__chevron {
    width: 9px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .st-story__arrow path,
  .st-story__chevron path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .st-story__arrow:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .st-story__header {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .st-story__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #d0204a;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .st-story__title {
    margin: 0;
    color: #111;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: min(62px, 17.8vw); /* board ink ~7% wider than the spec's 58; small phones keep "Brainwave" inside the column */
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .st-story__sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .st-story__standfirst {
    margin-block-start: 4px;
    color: var(--st-muted-text, #5c5f6b);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* Hero x 10–382 (372 × 442), radius 6: the chapter art's props, never wider than 1.3× its 270 px source. */
  .st-story__hero {
    position: relative;
    margin-inline: -12px;
    aspect-ratio: 372 / 442;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--st-story-set, var(--st-tint));
  }

  .st-story__hero img {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-end: 0;
    inset-inline-start: 50%;
    width: min(100%, 351px);
    max-width: none;
    height: auto;
    translate: -50% 0;
  }

  /* HD still life (Brainwave): centred, the box width. */
  .st-story__hero--still img {
    inset-block: 50% auto;
    width: 100%;
    translate: -50% -50%;
  }

  /* HD scene (Green Flag): the landing chapter's art in its 390-px frame, scaled to the box (--k as on the landing). */
  .st-story__hero--scene {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .st-story__hero .st-story__scene {
    --k: calc(100cqw / 390);
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline: 0;
    top: calc(var(--y0) * -1 * var(--k));
    height: calc(var(--sh) * var(--k));
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Positioned layers (Diet Cherry): card px of the 370-wide card, scaled with it. */
  .st-story__hero--layers {
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .st-story__hero--layers img {
    --k: calc(100cqw / 370);
    inset-block: calc(var(--t) * var(--k)) auto;
    inset-inline-start: calc(var(--l) * var(--k));
    width: calc(var(--w) * var(--k));
    translate: none;
  }

  .st-story__hero .st-story__scene .st-land__art {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .st-story__hero .st-story__scene img {
    position: static;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    height: auto;
    translate: none;
  }

  .st-story__pull {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: #111;
    font-family: var(--font-shop-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 33px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .st-story__track {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-columns: 100%;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .st-story__track::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .st-story__beat {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }

  /* Body grey: the spec's --st-body #6e7184 (the theme's --st-body is the brand setting, #272332). The story ground
     is #fffdf5, paper-like: 4.73:1. */
  .st-story__beat p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6e7184;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .st-story__track:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #d0204a;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* "Shop {set} →": a full pill, #a80f2a, white DM Sans 600 18 px. */
  .st-story__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4em;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-inline: -2px;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--st-radius-pill, 999px);
    background: #a80f2a;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .st-story__cta:hover {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #a80f2a 86%, #000);
  }

  .st-story__more {
    margin-block-start: 12px;
  }

  .st-story__more-heading {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .st-story__more ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .st-story__more li + li {
    border-block-start: 1px solid #e8e9eb;
  }

  .st-story__more-link {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 82px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    min-height: 68px;
    padding-block: 4px;
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .st-story__more-media {
    display: block;
    height: 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .st-story__more-text {
    display: grid;
  }

  .st-story__more-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .st-story__more-sub {
    color: var(--st-muted-text, #5c5f6b);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .st-story__chevron {
    color: #d0204a;
  }

  /* BEGIN store desktop (st-fable, qa/desktop/STORE-DESKTOP-SPEC.md v1 section 2) */
  /* >= 1024: hero art card 5fr, sticky under the header at min(100svh - header - 48px, 640px) tall (v1.2: a shorter
     372 x 380 card with the scene bottom-anchored, narrower where the column is), | the story 7fr: pager row, eyebrow, title, line, intro, beats, story text (68 ch),
     quote, "Shop the set" and More stories. st-beats becomes display: contents so its hero can take the left column
     (st-beats.js only measures its track). */
  @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
    .st-story {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr);
      column-gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 72px);
      align-items: start;
      max-width: none;
      width: min(1240px, 100% - 2 * clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px));
      padding: 24px 0 var(--st-section-space);
    }

    .st-story__beats {
      display: contents;
    }

    .st-story > *,
    .st-story__beats > * {
      grid-column: 2;
    }

    .st-story__beats > .st-story__hero {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 1 / span 8;
      align-self: start;
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--st-header-h, 76px) + 24px);
      width: min(100%, min(100svh - var(--st-header-h, 76px) - 48px, 640px) * 372 / 380);
      margin-inline: 0;
      aspect-ratio: 372 / 380;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .st-story__hero--scene .st-story__scene {
      top: auto;
      bottom: 0;
    }

    .st-story__hero--layers img {
      translate: 0 calc(-62 * var(--k));
    }

    .st-story__title {
      font-size: 71px;
    }

    .st-story__sub {
      font-size: 29px;
    }

    .st-story__standfirst {
      max-width: 68ch;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .st-story__pull {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .st-story__beat p,
    .st-story__body {
      max-width: 68ch;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .st-story__cta {
      justify-self: start;
      min-height: 52px;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .st-story__more {
      max-width: 68ch;
    }
  }
  /* END store desktop */

  /* BEGIN wide frame (Tier A, >= 1680: the page frame grows to min(1440px, 100% - 2 gutters), the Journal §F rule; grids widen, text keeps its measure) */
  @media screen and (min-width: 1680px) {
    .st-story {
      width: min(1440px, 100% - 2 * clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px));
    }

    /* the reading text keeps its 1240-frame measure (the 7fr column, 680 px): the grid widens, the paragraphs don't */
    .st-story__standfirst,
    .st-story__beat p,
    .st-story__body {
      max-width: min(68ch, 680px);
    }
  }
  /* END wide frame */
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Small Talk story",
  "class": "st-article-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "story_order",
      "label": "Story order (campaign handles)",
      "default": "on-me,brainwave,green-flag,shaadi-shift,diet-cherry,wild-card,pinky-promise",
      "info": "\"More stories\" shows the next three other stories in this order."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
